                        "glosses": [
                            "In a hermetic way.",
                            "With a hermetic seal; so as to be airtight."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d4298f7-1264-4459-83a6-068d6907a0cc",
                                "sense_id": "f69c6019-e37b-3000-a126-bd88c08043d9",
                                "text": "a hermetically sealed jar"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c68862a-840f-4dbd-bf36-f3f776b2c02d",
                                "sense_id": "f69c6019-e37b-3000-a126-bd88c08043d9",
                                "text": "they hermetically seal the jars"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7d4374d2-d64f-323b-b240-0337930ad6ef",
                        "entry_id": "3560b62d-9204-312c-875b-4818518afe42",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a hermetic way.",
                            "In an isolated manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "02790dc2-dbaa-4aca-9215-1b265b2f8272",
                                "sense_id": "7d4374d2-d64f-323b-b240-0337930ad6ef",
                                "text": "living hermetically"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "00de424a-18ac-4df3-aa61-c414cd663ddb",
                                "sense_id": "7d4374d2-d64f-323b-b240-0337930ad6ef",
                                "text": "Too often, this interchange of knowledge is thwarted, one way or another: the entropic leanings of the workplace foster hermetically isolated patterns of behavior."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6bcfa22a-bdc8-4766-9b76-07319915c677",
                                "sense_id": "7d4374d2-d64f-323b-b240-0337930ad6ef",
                                "text": "This was partly because of the fact that race issues were so contentious in the late 2010s, but anyone who thinks race wasn’t being discussed hotly in the late 1980s either wasn’t there or was living quite hermetically. The more important difference was social media, which propagates and even transforms terms more rapidly than broadcasting and print."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "26c6a218-36e7-463c-a2a0-8fcb5fe391de",
                        "source_entry_id": "3560b62d-9204-312c-875b-4818518afe42",
